sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React App
    participant API as FastAPI Auth API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>UI: Enter email and password
    UI->>API: Login request
    API->>DB: Check user record
    DB-->>API: User found
    API-->>UI: Return JWT token
    UI->>API: Request user profile
    API->>DB: Load user and role
    DB-->>API: User details
    API-->>UI: Authenticated user
    UI-->>User: Open dashboard
